# Local secrets and generated state must never be scanned — whatever the
# scan target is. config/ is gitignored and holds env values, rules, and
# inventory; the rest are value/key files wherever they may live.
# Dir patterns are root-anchored — a bare `config/` would also swallow
# any nested `config/` dir (gitignore semantics).
/config/
/coverage/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.env
**/.digest-key
